---
import "../../../styles/nopas-characters.css";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import neHero from "../../../assets/classes/NeedleEye/NeedleEye.png";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Needle Eye — Defender Class"
    description="Needle Eye is the UPDF's long-range specialist: precise, patient, and deeply offended by aliens who float where everyone can see them. Take high ground. Cover lanes. Place traps. Thread the shot."
>
<div class="character-pages defenders detail-page">
    {/* ============================================================
        Hero
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-hero relative overflow-hidden border-b border-[#8edcff]/20">
        <div
            class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 pointer-events-none"
            style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%, rgba(142, 220, 255, 0.16), transparent 60%);"
        ></div>

        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-10 pb-8 md:pt-12">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-display mb-8">
                <a href="/nopas/" class="transition">Game</a>
                <span>/</span>
                <a href="/nopas/defenders/" class="transition">Defenders</a>
                <span>/</span>
                <span class="">Needle Eye</span>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
                <div>
                    <p class="font-display text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.4em] uppercase">
                        Defender Class · Sniper / Overwatch
                    </p>
                    <h1 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-4xl mt-3 text-paper-glow leading-tight">
                        <span class="">NEEDLE<br/>EYE</span>
                    </h1><p class="character-mode-note">NOPAS MATCH · CHARACTER GUIDE</p>
                    <p class="mt-6 italic text-lg">
                        One shot. One perch. Zero patience for hovering weirdos.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Needle Eye is the UPDF's long-range specialist: precise,
                        patient, and deeply offended by aliens who float where
                        everyone can see them.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                        Take high ground, cover lanes, place traps, grapple into
                        position, and make the Collectors think twice before crossing
                        open space.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-6 font-display text-lg tracking-wide">
                        Thread the shot. Pin the threat. Protect the pants.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="relative aspect-square bg-[var(--bg-deep)] rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                    <Image src={neHero} alt="Needle Eye" widths={[480, 720, 960, 1200]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 540px, 90vw" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="eager" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================================================
        Role + Playstyle
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-section max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
        <div>
            <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Role Fantasy</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Control where enemies are willing to go.</h2>
            <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed">
                Your strength comes from positioning. Find a perch, cover important
                routes, support citizens from above, and force the Collectors to
                respect the sightline.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                You are not just shooting enemies. You are controlling where enemies
                are willing to go.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 italic leading-relaxed">
                The UPDF calls that tactical overwatch.<br/>
                Needle Eye calls it &ldquo;finally, some quiet.&rdquo;
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Playstyle</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Precision. Traps. Patience.</h2>
            <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed">
                You should look for high ground, watch alien approach routes,
                protect citizens from a distance, and pressure major threats like
                the Commander or Overlord.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                You are strongest when you think ahead. Pick the right perch. Mine
                the right route. Grapple before you are surrounded.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 italic leading-relaxed">
                A good Needle Eye makes aliens feel watched.<br/>
                A great Needle Eye makes them feel late.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================================================
        Abilities
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-section character-abilities max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-6">
            <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase">
                Combat Identity
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-4xl mt-3 text-paper-glow">
                Abilities & Loadout
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="surface rounded-lg p-4 border border-[#8edcff]/20">
                <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Signature Weapon</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg">Sewing Needle Rifle</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                    A long-range precision weapon for picking off threats and
                    pressuring important targets.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Originally designed for tailoring.<br/>
                    Heavily modified after the tailor complained about aliens.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface rounded-lg p-4 border border-[#8edcff]/20">
                <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Sidearm</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg">Pin Pistol</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                    A reliable sidearm for closer threats.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Because sometimes the aliens do not respect your preferred
                    engagement distance.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface rounded-lg p-4 border border-[#8edcff]/20">
                <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Area Denial</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg">Pin Mines</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Place traps on likely routes, perches, or rescue paths.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    A well-placed mine turns alien confidence into alien regret.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="surface rounded-lg p-4 border border-[#8edcff]/20">
                <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Mobility</p>
                <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg">Grappling Hook</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Reposition quickly, reach perches, and escape danger.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Needle Eye does not climb stairs when physics can be persuaded.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================================================
        Setup + Final Stand
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-section max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="surface rounded-lg p-6 border-l-2 border-[#8edcff]/40">
            <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">During Setup Phase</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg">Prepare the map.</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                Find overwatch spots. Watch citizen safe zones. Place traps along
                likely invasion routes. Cover buildings where Defenders are hiding
                citizens.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
                The aliens may scout from above.<br/>
                Needle Eye scouts back with judgment.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="surface rounded-lg p-6 border-l-2 border-[var(--color-magenta-500)]/40">
            <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Final Stand</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg">The punctuation mark.</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                Cover cannons, lanes, rooftops, and incoming threats. Pick off
                minions before they swarm. Pressure major Collectors. If an alien
                starts a big dramatic push, make it regret doing that in your
                sightline.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 italic text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Final Stand is chaos.<br/>
                Needle Eye is the punctuation mark.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================================================
        Lore
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-section character-lore max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
        <div class="surface rounded-lg p-5 md:p-6 border-l-2 border-[#8edcff]/40">
            <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Lore</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">From threading needles to threading aliens.</h2>
            <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed">
                Needle Eye began as a quiet specialist in precision tailoring and
                long-distance measurement.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                Then the Collectors invaded, and the UPDF discovered that someone
                who could thread a needle at fifty yards could also make aliens
                extremely nervous at much greater distances.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 italic leading-relaxed">
                Needle Eye accepted the role on one condition:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 leading-relaxed">
                <li>&mdash; No speeches.</li>
                <li>&mdash; No group chants.</li>
                <li>&mdash; No one touches the perch.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 italic leading-relaxed">
                The UPDF agreed immediately and then wrote several speeches anyway.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================================================
        Quotes
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-section character-quotes max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
        <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-center">
            Field Recordings
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl mt-3 text-paper-glow text-center">
            Heard from the rooftop.
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <blockquote class="surface rounded-lg p-4 text-sm italic">
                &ldquo;Hold still. This is already difficult enough.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>
            <blockquote class="surface rounded-lg p-4 text-sm italic">
                &ldquo;I see the problem. It is orange.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>
            <blockquote class="surface rounded-lg p-4 text-sm italic">
                &ldquo;The sky is not a safe zone.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>
            <blockquote class="surface rounded-lg p-4 text-sm italic">
                &ldquo;Pinned one.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>
            <blockquote class="surface rounded-lg p-4 text-sm italic md:col-span-2 text-center">
                &ldquo;If they didn't want to be sniped, they should be invisible.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================================================
        Roster wrap
       ============================================================ */}
    <section class="character-section max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 text-center border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
        <p class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">UPDF Roster Complete</p>
        <a href="/nopas/defenders/" class="block mt-4 group">
            <h3 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-paper-glow transition">
                Back to the UPDF &nbsp;→
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">
                Pick your role. Hold the line. Save Earth's denim.
            </p>
        </a>
    </section>
<nav class="character-footer-nav" aria-label="Explore the factions"><a href="/nopas/">← NOPAS overview</a><a href="/nopas/defenders/">Meet the Defenders ↗</a><a href="/nopas/collectors/">Meet the Collectors ↗</a><a href="/nopas/survivors/">Survivors guide ↗</a></nav>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
